flowchart TB
  Internet --> TLS[Deployment TLS ingress]
  TLS --> Web[Next.js frontend process]
  Web --> API[FastAPI process]
  API --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
  API --> S3[(Private S3)]
  Worker[Separately supervised worker process] --> DB
  Worker --> S3
  Worker --> LocalModel[Provisioned local embedding/OCR dependencies]
  API --> Qdrant[(Optional Qdrant)]
  Worker --> Qdrant
  API --> LLM[Optional external compatible LLM]
  CI[GitHub Actions checks] -. validation only; no deploy .-> API
